.TH MIOS 1 "" "MiOS 0.3.0" "MiOS Manual"
.SH NAME
mios \- the MiOS verb dispatcher
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mios
.I verb
.SH DESCRIPTION
MiOS exposes its capabilities as verbs. Every verb below is declared
in the single source of truth and has its own page: run
.B man mios\-verb
for any of them.
.SH VERBS
.TP
.B verify
Verify the Day\-0 image.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/mios/mios.toml
The single source of truth.
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/mios/manual/
The distilled prose manual.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mios.toml (5),
.BR mios (7)
